{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Great Places to Visit", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "All That Jazz", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Would Rather for What Is Preferable", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use the expression <span class=\"strong italic\">would rather</span> to ask for or express preference. We generally used its contracted form (<span class=\"strong italic\">'d rather</span>), followed by the basic or infinitive form of the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Examples: <ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather have customers like him than the rude clients I get all the time!</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather just have a quiet dinner with you guys.</span></li> </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: We should have a party soon! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I don't know ... I'd rather just have a quiet dinner. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Come on! You ought to put more fun in your life!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you're comparing two things or actions, you use the expression <span class=\"strong italic\">than</span>. When you're comparing with verbs, be consistent: don't change the form of the verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather go to the Jazz festival than stay at home.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">We'd rather have a party with friends than have a quiet afternoon.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you state preference in relation to another person's actions, that is, if you prefer someone to do something, <span class=\"strong\">you use the verb in the past form</span>.<br/> There is another subject for the second part of the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather <span class=\"strong\">you</span> <span class=\"underline\">came</span> home for a party.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">We'd rather <span class=\"strong\">he</span> <span class=\"underline\">played</span> jazz.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather <span class=\"strong\">they</span> <span class=\"underline\">weren't</span> regular customers.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'd rather <span class=\"strong\">the saxophonist</span> <span class=\"underline\">attended</span> the party.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Questions With How + Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">How + adjective</span> in a question if you want to know how someone or something is.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "How funny is that?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " How cute was he?  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How big is this party going to be?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "biologist ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a scientist who focuses on living organisms ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Darwin was the most influential biologist of his time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "specimen ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an individual example of a species ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In the summer you can see many specimens of wildlife.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "expedition ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a journey with a specific purpose, like exploration or research ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How amazing would it be to take part in an expedition to this remote land.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "volcanic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " relating to a volcano ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Galapagos are an archipelago of volcanic islands.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "solo ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a part in a musical piece where one instrument plays unaccompanied ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This saxophone solo was amazing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mesmerizing ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "holding someone's attention very intensely ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Jazz performers are mesmerizing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (12-14 lines) about your plans for the weekend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, think of 5 or 6 things to do. Make sure you include: <ul> <li>activities and occasions</li> <li>names of buildings and places</li> </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make suggestions and talk about preferences. Express your disagreement on the activities. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find one suggestion that you both agree on.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about preferences and make suggestions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification about things and people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about celebrations, buildings and special occasions.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le15ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How was your week, Vanessa? How busy was the restaurant?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: It hasn't stopped all week! A group of biologists came to celebrate the discovery of a new specimen of iguana in the Galapagos. They went on and on about their expedition to the volcanic islands!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I just wrote an article about the Galapagos! How funny is that?", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Yeah, that's weird. I also had a group of musicians who were in town for the jazz festival. They came in after their show and the saxophonist played us a solo. He was \u2026 mesmerizing.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell me the truth, V. How cute was he?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Very funny, Sally. I'd rather have customers like him than the rude clients I get all the time!", "time": "18900"}, {"image": "engenn6le15ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess so. Hey! We should have a party soon, don't you think?    <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: I don't know \u2026 I'd rather just have a quiet dinner with you guys.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come on! You ought to put more fun in your life! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: How big is this party going to be?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Don't worry about that. You might want to invite that saxophonist though!", "time": "41200"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob11re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about natural features, structures and celebrations. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can make suggestions and talk about what is preferable.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can ask for clarification about the characteristics of a thing. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How was your week? Good or bad? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What would you rather do next week?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Sally talk about assignments, cute saxophonists <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">and all that jazz</span>.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": 